data
  title Lazy-load decision: size x first paint
  desc Two axes decide it — is the component over 30 KB, and does it render on first paint? Only large + deferred earns its own chunk.
  compares
    - label Large + deferred — lazy-load it
    - label Large + on first paint — keep
    - label Small + deferred — keep inline
    - label Small + on first paint — keep
